; Alveo U50 10G MAC validation harnesses. Board-level bring-up scaffolding, kept
; OUTSIDE lib/ for the same reason validation/dune is: lib/ holds the reusable MAC,
; this holds the throwaway silicon scaffolding that drives it.
;
; Unlike the Arty harnesses this library does NOT depend on helper_circuits: there is
; no Arty_board_top pin contract to reuse, because the Hardcaml design is not the top
; level here -- it sits inside u50_10g_top.sv next to the AMD PCS/GT IP.
;
; RTL is emitted by the unified generator:
;   dune exec lib/common/generate.exe -- u50-10g-tx-validation
;
;  This file was heavily edited by AI, as I find no use in wasting away at writing
;  validation harnesses myself. If you have problems with this, bite me.

(library
 (name u50_validation)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries core hardcaml mac_10g_of_hardcaml)
 (modules u50_scaffolding u50_frame_source u50_mac_tx_harness)
 (flags
  (:standard -w -27-57-33-34-35-40-63-47-26))
 (preprocess
  (pps ppx_hardcaml ppx_jane))
 (lint
  (pps ppx_js_style)))
